            <ArticleTitle>[Characteristics of circadian variations in the cardiointervalogram of patients with ischemic heart disease].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>7-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The analysis of heart rate in patients with ischemic heart disease revealed its differences in different periods of a day. In severe disease forms, the daily fluctuation range of some cardiointervalogram parameters is higher and their acrophase is shifted to the night and early morning hours.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
